{#-
  BLOCK: spec_list — §06's `spec_list`.

  `strip`: four cells across on `#F8FAFC` with a 1px `#ECEAE3` border, 20px
  value over an 11px uppercase label (Design's 5th package). Values are ink
  (`#0F172A`), not brand: the strip is facts, and the one brand-coloured
  number on the page is the hero's.

  `supporting`: three cells, no fill, a hairline on top (Price Bands).

  `tr-stack` IS B4 AND IS NOT DECORATION. The mobile rule that stacks the
  cells on a phone is defined in the document's <style> block, and a rule
  attached to nothing is a rule that never fires (it was, once, and 10px labels
  wrapped to three lines at 320px). `test_no_responsive_rule_is_defined_and_
  unused` keeps every such rule attached to something.
-#}
{% if variant == 'supporting' %}
          <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:18px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
            {%- for label, value in stats %}<td class="tr-stack tr-rule" width="{{ cell_width }}" valign="top" style="padding:12px 10px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div class="tr-ink" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#0F172A;">{{ value }}</div><div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748B;">{{ label }}</div></td>{% endfor %}
          </tr></table></td></tr>
{% else %}
          <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:14px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
            {%- for label, value in stats %}<td class="tr-cell tr-stack" width="25%" valign="top" style="padding:14px 12px;background:#F8FAFC;border:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div class="tr-ink" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#0F172A;">{{ value }}</div><div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748B;">{{ label }}</div></td>{% endfor %}
          </tr></table></td></tr>
{% endif %}
